title: Salem3Start
---
<<declare $playerName="Holder">>
<<gatherVars>>
You went to see Salem at the café as usual.

Inside, a different server stood behind the counter.

He glanced at you, then back to his phone.

You checked her usual corner. She wasn’t there.

You: "Hey,"

He sighed and looked at you again.

You: "Do you know where Salem is?"

He looked at you, confused at first.

Then realization hit.

Coworker: "The Indian chick?"

Coworker: "She said she wanted to paint."

Coworker: "We swapped shifts."

Coworker: "If she's painting, try the art department."

Coworker: "It's down the steps from here."

You thanked him and left.

The spiral stairs led down the hill.

At the bottom sat the art department.

You buzzed to be let in.

Someone opened the door, surprised.

Person: "Hi, who are you?"

You: "Salem's friend,"

It felt like a stretch, but it worked.

They nodded and opened the door wider.

Person: "Second room on your left."

Person: "You're lucky she lets you in."

Person: "She doesn't do that for everyone."

That made you uneasy.

Still, you moved forward.

The halls displayed past student work.

You didn’t stop to look.

You reached the door and opened it quietly.

Salem stood inside.

For once... she looked emotionless.

-> Compliment Her
    <<incRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump ComplimentHer>>
-> Compliment her painting
    <<jump ComplimentHerPainting>>
-> This is boring
    <<decRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump IsBoring>>
===

title: ComplimentHer
---
She was mesmerizing as she worked.

Her face was still, her focus precise.

Each brushstroke was deliberate.

She looked like a statue in motion.

It felt like something private.

You turned to leave.

Salem: "You can stay,"

<<jump Salem3Pt2>>
===

title: ComplimentHerPainting
---
Her strokes blended colors into a masterpiece.

Every detail was carefully placed.

The painting showed a glowing gate.

It shimmered with an eerie blue light.

It felt wrong to look at.

You stepped away.

Salem: "You can stay,"

<<jump Salem3Pt2>>
===

title: IsBoring
---
You stopped watching and waited.

Eventually, she noticed you.

Her gaze snapped out of its trance.

Salem: "Oh- Hello {$playerName},"

Salem: "I didn't know you were there...,"

She looked embarrassed.

You: "Sorry, I shouldn't have barged in,"

You: "I can leave-"

Salem: "No!"

Salem: "No, it's okay, you can stay,"

<<jump Salem3Pt2>>
===

title: Salem3Pt2
