===

title: FeelAlright
---
You frowned, concern showing.

You: "Do you feel alright?"

You: "Did you even eat?"

She looked surprised, then smiled.

Salem: "I did, don't worry,"

Salem: "And I feel alright too,"

She giggled.

You sighed softly.

<<jump Salem3Pt3>>
===

title: ShouldntDo
---
You stepped closer, frowning.

You: "You shouldn't overwork yourself like that,"

She gave a tight smile.

Salem: "Don't worry about me, {$playerName},"

Salem: "Painting helps me process things,"

Her voice was low.

You relented.

<<jump Salem3Pt3>>
===

title: AdmireDedication
---
You looked back at the painting.

It still felt wrong.

You: "I admire your dedication,"

She stayed silent.

Her expression felt... off.

<<jump Salem3Pt3>>
===

title: Salem3Pt3
---
Salem: "Here,"

She pulled a paper from her pocket.

Salem: "Your questions are thought provoking,"

Salem: "Strangely, I like it,"

Her voice drifted as she resumed painting.

You unfolded the paper.

There was paint smudged on it.

