===

title: NoSalem3
---
You looked away.

You: "I'm sorry Salem,"

You: "I can't help you,"

She forced a small smile.

Salem: "Oh, that's alright,"

She giggled softly.

You smiled weakly.

<<jump Salem3End>>
===

title: YesSalem3
---
You didn’t see harm in helping her.

You: "Sure, I'll help you,"

She lit up instantly.

Salem: "Oh thank you!"

Salem: "Meet me at the cafe okay?"

You smiled back.

<<jump Salem3End>>
===

title: Salem3End
---
You expected her usual smile.

But she kept painting.

Slow. Precise. Mechanical.

You: "Thanks, Salem,"

She didn’t look up.

She hummed softly.

You placed the next question beside her.

You stepped away.

At the door, you glanced back.

She was still painting.

It felt unsettling.

You left quietly.
===